{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14226820","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14226820","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1422682001:0":{"text":"谢、谢谢，吓死我了，还以为这次彻底完蛋了呢……","source_cn":"谢、谢谢，吓死我了，还以为这次彻底完蛋了呢……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7261CF466A87C412","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1422682002:0":{"text":"您、您不是因度厄大人吗！太感谢了！","source_cn":"您、您不是因度厄大人吗！太感谢了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD3360BA9145F32E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1422682003:0":{"text":"……这里怎么也会有孽化者出现？卫兵们没有在附近巡逻吗？","source_cn":"……这里怎么也会有孽化者出现？卫兵们没有在附近巡逻吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFDC6F798E8C039BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1422682004:1":{"text":"我、我不知道啊！我也是想着这里肯定安全，才出来弄吃的。","source_cn":"我、我不知道啊！我也是想着这里肯定安全，才出来弄吃的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6927F7F60FFA0911","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1422682005:1":{"text":"沙利叶不至于在这种事上玩忽职守，恐怕是防守的人手不够……","source_cn":"沙利叶不至于在这种事上玩忽职守，恐怕是防守的人手不够……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9172072F0C9A7DCD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1422682006:1":{"text":"……也可能是孽化的情况更严重了。","source_cn":"……也可能是孽化的情况更严重了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5CC8399E0B119919","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1422682007:1":{"text":"你回去找沙利叶，把遇袭和见到我的事情跟他说清楚。","source_cn":"你回去找沙利叶，把遇袭和见到我的事情跟他说清楚。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D736AA45E9FF7A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1422682008:1":{"text":"好、好的。因度厄大人，我先过去！","source_cn":"好、好的。因度厄大人，我先过去！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD6CED6C9ABB0197B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1422682009:1":{"text":"因度厄，刚刚我们面对的那个怪物，就是你们提到的孽化的……艾塞勒？","source_cn":"因度厄，刚刚我们面对的那个怪物，就是你们提到的孽化的…...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x226F768CB8A2CFF1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1422682010:1":{"text":"是的，一开始长出鳞片，接着肢体扭曲，最终连理智都烧尽了……","source_cn":"是的，一开始长出鳞片，接着肢体扭曲，最终连理智都烧尽了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4C019E8B238B8E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1422682011:1":{"text":"彻底沦为怪物。","source_cn":"彻底沦为怪物。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE3798222D8DA6EBB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1422682012:1":{"text":"这简直……","source_cn":"这简直……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC806A4A5FA72B6F5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1422682013:1":{"text":"所以，比起被塔兰河冲刷的痛苦来说，孽化才是真正的折磨。","source_cn":"所以，比起被塔兰河冲刷的痛苦来说，孽化才是真正的折磨。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xABF82D85B47F3436","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1422682014:1":{"text":"孽化，除了诅咒外，也可以说是龙对我们的窃取与贪婪的惩戒吧。","source_cn":"孽化，除了诅咒外，也可以说是龙对我们的窃取与贪婪的惩戒吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x72B4595C06DEBF6D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1422682015:1":{"text":"龙的惩戒，弥萨忒的惩戒……","source_cn":"龙的惩戒，弥萨忒的惩戒……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE7F2F5B56D1C814","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1422682016:1":{"text":"我们艾塞勒最终在两种惩戒交织下沉沦。","source_cn":"我们艾塞勒最终在两种惩戒交织下沉沦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC3ABC81F94B9545","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1422682017:1":{"text":"……所以，我必须要加快脚步，否则，不知道还有多少人会继续经受这种苦痛。","source_cn":"……所以，我必须要加快脚步，否则，不知道还有多少人会继...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8EB36CAE74959072","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1422682018:1":{"text":"……我明白了。我们去找纯净的土元素吧。时间不等人。","source_cn":"……我明白了。我们去找纯净的土元素吧。时间不等人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC8158BBB245B5FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:遇袭的平民":{"text":"遇袭的平民","source":"遇袭的平民","status":"source"},"speaker:因度厄":{"text":"因度厄","source":"因度厄","status":"source"},"speaker:埃隆":{"text":"埃隆","source":"埃隆","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":19,"localized_text_count":18,"speaker_count":3}}